      "text": "because Jews have despised the Holy One, they shall wander, 1 Ne. 19:14. rich despise poor, 2 Ne. 9:30. rich and proud are they whom God despises, 2 Ne. 9:42. the Lord’s anger is kindled against his people because they despised word of the Holy One, 2 Ne. 15:24. despise not revelations of God, Jacob 4:8. the Messiah is despised and rejected of men, Mosiah 14:3 (Isa. 53:3). surely God shall not suffer that we, who are despised because we take upon us Christ’s name, shall be destroyed, Alma 46:18. man with two masters will hold to one and despise other, 3 Ne. 13:24 (Matt. 6:24). false church despises true Church because of miracles, 4 Ne. 1:29. who will despise works of the Lord, Morm. 9:26–27.",
